      "html" : "<table cellSpacing=\"0\" style=\"width: 768px&#10;                ;\"><colgroup><col width=\"62.5%&#10;              \"><\/col><col width=\"18.75%&#10;              \"><\/col><col width=\"18.75%&#10;              \"><\/col><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Installation<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Continuous<br><\/br>Special Inspection<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Periodic<br><\/br>Special Inspection<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">1.&#160;&#160;&#160;Prior to placing concrete, inspect the inside of the pile for alignment and damage. Record the results of the inspection, noting whether or not the pile is in compliance with Section <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-179573', hash: '#JD_BC1812' }}\">1812<\/Link> and the construction documents.<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">X<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">&#8212;<\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">2.&#160;&#160;&#160;Witness the placement of concrete or grout inside the deep foundation element, and record the volume placed. Note the date and time of placement, and whether or not the concrete or grout was placed in compliance with Section <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-179573', hash: '#JD_BC1812' }}\">1812<\/Link> and the construction documents.<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">X<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">&#8212;<\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table>",
